NOTE ON BUNDLED HARDWARE ARTEFACTS

The files under board/hw-handoff/ (IMAGE_15EG.xsa, IMAGE_15EG_wrapper.bit/.mmi,
psu_init*) and the PS preset board/XCZU15EG_Base_Config.tcl are derived from the
manufacturer-supplied development-kit materials for the RK-XCZU15EG-F board and
remain the property of their respective owners (RIGUKE / Xilinx-AMD). They are
included here as a board-support reference for users of that hardware. The MIT
license above applies to the build scripts, device-tree sources, constraints,
and documentation authored in this repository.
